{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36667","headline":"寄三衢孙员外 · 罗隐","name":"寄三衢孙员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小敷文伯见何时，南望三衢渴复饥。\n天子未能崇典诰，诸生徒欲恋旌旗。\n风高绿野苗千顷，露冷平楼酒满巵。\n尽是数旬陪奉处，使君争肯不相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}